Taste n: Name. Taste z: Zahl oder Text? Taste w: Wahrheitswert.</notes><thumbnail></thumbnail><stage name="Bühne" width="480" height="360" costume="0" tempo="60" threadsafe="false" penlog="false" volume="100" pan="0" lines="round" ternary="false" hyperops="true" codify="false" inheritance="true" sublistIDs="false" scheduled="false" id="1"><pentrails></pentrails><costumes><list id="2"></list></costumes><sounds><list id="3"></list></sounds><variables></variables><blocks></blocks><scripts></scripts><sprites select="1"><sprite name="Figur" idx="1" x="0" y="0" heading="90" scale="1" volume="100" pan="0" rotation="1" draggable="true" costume="0" color="80,80,80,1" pen="tip" id="8"><costumes><list id="9"></list></costumes><sounds><list id="10"></list></sounds><blocks></blocks><variables></variables><scripts><comment x="20" y="20" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript A (Flagge): Wie viele Punkte stehen am Ende in der Variable?</comment><script x="20" y="82"><block s="receiveGo"></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>punkte</l><l>0</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><l>Los geht's!</l><l>1</l></block><block s="doChangeVar"><l>punkte</l><l>1</l></block><block s="doChangeVar"><l>punkte</l><l>1</l></block><block s="doChangeVar"><l>punkte</l><l>5</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><l>Du hast </l><block var="punkte"/><l> Punkte.</l></list></block><l>3</l></block></script><comment x="320" y="20" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript B (Taste n): Eine Zeichenkette in einer Variable.</comment><script x="320" y="82"><block s="receiveKey"><l>n</l></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Wie heißt du?</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>name</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><l>Hallo </l><block var="name"/><l>!</l></list></block><l>2</l></block></script><comment x="320" y="216" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript C (Taste z): Zweimal 'zahl' und 10 – zwei verschiedene Ergebnisse. Warum?</comment><script x="320" y="278"><block s="receiveKey"><l>z</l></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Nenne eine Zahl:</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>zahl</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportVariadicSum"><list><block var="zahl"/><l>10</l></list></block><l>2</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportJoinWords"><list><block var="zahl"/><l>10</l></list></block><l>2</l></block></script><comment x="20" y="285" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript D (Taste w): Was speichert die Variable 'ist gross'?</comment><script x="20" y="347"><block s="receiveKey"><l>w</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>ist gross</l><block s="reportVariadicGreaterThan"><list><block var="punkte"/><l>5</l></list></block></block><block s="doSayFor"><block var="ist gross"/><l>2</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><block s="reportIsA"><block var="ist gross"/><l><option>Boolean</option></l></block><l>2</l></block></script></scripts></sprite><watcher var="punkte" style="normal" x="10" y="10" color="243,118,29"/><watcher var="name" style="normal" x="10" y="38" color="243,118,29"/><watcher var="zahl" style="normal" x="10" y="66" color="243,118,29"/><watcher var="ist gross" style="normal" x="10" y="94" color="243,118,29"/></sprites></stage><hidden></hidden><headers></headers><code></code><blocks></blocks><variables><variable name="punkte"><l>0</l></variable><variable name="name"><l></l></variable><variable name="zahl"><l>0</l></variable><variable name="ist gross"><l></l></variable></variables></project>